    "Name": "Winston Mk.X",
    "Details": "The Winston Combat Vehicle was a Republic of the Sphere frontline combat vehicle that began production in 3085. The Mk.X has seen upgrades and refits across the board by RISC engineers from its weapon systems to electronics. These upgrades coupled with the included Anti-Spall armor makes the Mk.X an incredibly tough nut to crack.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Reflective Coating\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       275     35\n<b>Left</b>         210     35\n<b>Right</b>       210     35\n<b>Rear</b>        150     35\n<b>Turret</b>      275     35\n\n<b>Total</b>      1120    175</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Improved Targeting - Long</color>",
    "Icon": "Winston"
